## 经典贪心问题

### 1. 活动选择问题
```java
public int activitySelection(int[] start, int[] end) {
    // 按结束时间排序
    int n = start.length;
    int[][] activities = new int[n][2];
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        activities[i] = new int[]{start[i], end[i]};
    }
    Arrays.sort(activities, (a, b) -> a[1] - b[1]);

    int count = 1;
    int lastEnd = activities[0][1];
    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
        if (activities[i][0] >= lastEnd) {
            count++;
            lastEnd = activities[i][1];
        }
    }
    return count;
}
```

### 2. 分发糖果
```java
public int candy(int[] ratings) {
    int n = ratings.length;
    int[] candies = new int[n];
    Arrays.fill(candies, 1);

    // 从左到右：如果右边评估高，糖果数加1
    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
        if (ratings[i] > ratings[i - 1]) {
            candies[i] = candies[i - 1] + 1;
        }
    }

    // 从右到左：如果左边评估高，取较大值
    for (int i = n - 2; i >= 0; i--) {
        if (ratings[i] > ratings[i + 1]) {
            candies[i] = Math.max(candies[i], candies[i + 1] + 1);
        }
    }

    int total = 0;
    for (int candy : candies) {
        total += candy;
    }
    return total;
}
```

### 3. 跳跃游戏
```java
public boolean canJump(int[] nums) {
    int maxReach = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
        if (i > maxReach) return false;
        maxReach = Math.max(maxReach, i + nums[i]);
    }
    return true;
}
```

理解时可以优先抓住「准确解释贪心算法的定义和适用条件；能解释贪心算法的解题步骤；能实现经典贪心问题」。这些点分别对应定义、执行流程和边界条件；要把触发条件、状态变化和结果影响串起来，而不是孤立背词。

## 贪心与动态规划的区别

### 1. 选择方式
- **贪心**：每步选择当前最优，不考虑未来
- **DP**：考虑所有子问题的最优解，选择全局最优

### 2. 适用场景
- **贪心**：适用于有贪心选择性质的问题
- **DP**：适用于有最优子结构和重叠子问题的问题

### 3. 示例对比：零钱兑换
```java
// 贪心解法（不一定正确）
public int coinChangeGreedy(int[] coins, int amount) {
    Arrays.sort(coins);
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = coins.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        while (amount >= coins[i]) {
            amount -= coins[i];
            count++;
        }
    }
    return amount == 0 ? count : -1;
}

// DP解法（一定正确）
public int coinChangeDP(int[] coins, int amount) {
    int[] dp = new int[amount + 1];
    Arrays.fill(dp, amount + 1);
    dp[0] = 0;
    for (int i = 1; i <= amount; i++) {
        for (int coin : coins) {
            if (coin <= i) {
                dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1);
            }
        }
    }
    return dp[amount] > amount ? -1 : dp[amount];
}
```

### 4. 为什么贪心不一定正确？
对于coins = [1, 3, 4]，amount = 6：
- 贪心：6 = 4 + 1 + 1（3个硬币）
- DP：6 = 3 + 3（2个硬币）
贪心选择了当前最大的4，但导致需要更多硬币。

// 贪心算法示例
import java.util.*;

public class GreedyBasics {

    // 1. 活动选择问题
    public int activitySelection(int[] start, int[] end) {
        int n = start.length;
        int[][] activities = new int[n][2];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            activities[i] = new int[]{start[i], end[i]};
        }
        Arrays.sort(activities, (a, b) -> a[1] - b[1]);

        int count = 1;
        int lastEnd = activities[0][1];
        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
            if (activities[i][0] >= lastEnd) {
                count++;
                lastEnd = activities[i][1];
            }
        }
        return count;
    }

    // 2. 分发糖果
    public int candy(int[] ratings) {
        int n = ratings.length;
        int[] candies = new int[n];
        Arrays.fill(candies, 1);

        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
            if (ratings[i] > ratings[i - 1]) {
                candies[i] = candies[i - 1] + 1;
            }
        }

        for (int i = n - 2; i >= 0; i--) {
            if (ratings[i] > ratings[i + 1]) {
                candies[i] = Math.max(candies[i], candies[i + 1] + 1);
            }
        }

        int total = 0;
        for (int candy : candies) {
            total += candy;
        }
        return total;
    }

    // 3. 跳跃游戏
    public boolean canJump(int[] nums) {
        int maxReach = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
            if (i > maxReach) return false;
            maxReach = Math.max(maxReach, i + nums[i]);
        }
        return true;
    }

    // 4. 用最少数量的箭引爆气球
    public int findMinArrowShots(int[][] points) {
        if (points.length == 0) return 0;
        Arrays.sort(points, (a, b) -> Integer.compare(a[1], b[1]));

        int arrows = 1;
        int end = points[0][1];
        for (int i = 1; i < points.length; i++) {
            if (points[i][0] > end) {
                arrows++;
                end = points[i][1];
            }
        }
        return arrows;
    }

    // 5. 买卖股票的最佳时机 II
    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {
        int profit = 0;
        for (int i = 1; i < prices.length; i++) {
            if (prices[i] > prices[i - 1]) {
                profit += prices[i] - prices[i - 1];
            }
        }
        return profit;
    }

    // 6. 无重叠区间
    public int eraseOverlapIntervals(int[][] intervals) {
        if (intervals.length == 0) return 0;
        Arrays.sort(intervals, (a, b) -> Integer.compare(a[1], b[1]));

        int count = 0;
        int end = intervals[0][1];
        for (int i = 1; i < intervals.length; i++) {
            if (intervals[i][0] < end) {
                count++;
            } else {
                end = intervals[i][1];
            }
        }
        return count;
    }
}
